{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113901","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113901/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113901/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113901/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113901","id":3720057351,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7du5IH","number":113901,"title":"Label3D with Autowrap Word does not wrap Chinese/Japanese text in exported builds (works only in editor)","user":{"login":"Xlebncat","id":47606990,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjA2OTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47606990?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat","html_url":"https://github.com/Xlebncat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-12-11T16:15:25Z","updated_at":"2025-12-11T17:29:36Z","closed_at":"2025-12-11T17:22:30Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable (f62fdbde1) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8180) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 15.92 ГиБ memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThere is an issue with Label3D when using Autowrap Mode = Word and displaying Chinese or Japanese text.\n\nIn the editor preview and when running the game from the editor, the text wraps correctly.\n\nHowever, after exporting the project, all Chinese/Japanese characters stay on one line.\n\nSwitching Autowrap Mode to \"Word (Smart)\" fixes the issue in the exported build, but normal \"Word\" mode stops working.\n\nThis issue happens only with CJK languages. English text wraps correctly in all modes.\n\n**Editor run (working)**\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1392\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cbfa3140-f7ee-4d5a-8978-59eb680e4b6b\" />\n\n**Exported build (broken)**\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1392\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/314c778b-321a-4383-9a32-332116377af6\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a Label3D node.\n\nSet: \nAutowrap Mode = Word\nWidth to a value that should normally cause the text to wrap.\n\nInsert Chinese or Japanese text\n\nRun the scene in the editor → Wrapping works.\n\nExport the project (e.g. Windows) and run the exported build → Wrapping does NOT work.\n\nChange Autowrap Mode to Word (Smart) → Wrapping works again.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Xlebncat","id":47606990,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjA2OTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47606990?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat","html_url":"https://github.com/Xlebncat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xlebncat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113901/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113901/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}